  "description": "Erection of a single-storey side/rear infill extension\r\rThe extension will be positioned to the rear of the original dwellinghouse and will be single storey in height with a flat roof. The maximum height will not exceed 4.0 metres and the eaves height will not exceed 3.0 metres.\r\rThe width of the infill extension will be less than two-thirds of the width of the original dwellinghouse, as shown on the submitted drawings.\r\rThe extension will be constructed in materials to match the existing dwelling, including matching brickwork and windows.\r\rNo new access arrangements are proposed. No new hardstanding, street works or changes to site access are required. Surface water drainage will connect to the existing drainage system.\r\rThe submitted plans clearly indicate the precise siting, footprint and dimensions of the proposed extension.",
